  "reason": "Existing evidence shows multiprofile RNA-only models with scvi_n200 encoder (config_005) achieve the highest accuracy (0.6501). This experiment tests whether switching to scgpt encoder (a more advanced RNA encoder) in multiprofile setup preserves or improves performance, isolating the impact of RNA encoder choice. It directly compares scgpt to scvi_n200 in the same multiprofile context with avgpool aggregation (proven better than transformer in prior tests), providing critical insight into whether encoder architecture is a key differentiator without introducing other variables."
